<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-12848] SQL: H2Connection leaks on INSERT</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-12848</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;H2 connection leaks on INSERT query when one row is inserted and not constant values are used:&lt;br/&gt;
e.g.:&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;tt&gt;INSERT INTO T VALUES(1, CURRENT_TIMESTAM());&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Root cause:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Query cursor isn&apos;t closed at the &lt;tt&gt;IgniteH2Indexing#executeUpdateNonTransactional&lt;/tt&gt; after &lt;tt&gt;DmlUtils#processSelectResult&lt;/tt&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
